LESSONS LEARNED 

still having trouble remembering to unwield pick-axe etc.
  ...doing wieldless takes lots of discipline; unwield IMMEDIATELY, EACH TIME
[oMR is pretty useless to Monk, since removing robe hurts spellcasting
sacfest seems to give low ROI for wieldless Monk (swords)
  ...instead, #offer to determine status, and #pray more regularly
     ...once you have the Eyes you'll know status
  ...golden glow for HP+ is worth it, plus spellbooks
liches (and other spell-casting monsters) are DANGEROUS at melee without MR
  ...Destroy Armor, Curse Items, Stun
  ...therefore: make sure we have MR before Medusa/Castle
Neutral Monk gets a different set of "sometimes peaceful creatures"
  ...double-check them before zapping from afar
the pick-axe fountain trick needs to be considered DANGEROUS
  ...before jumping: review inventory one last time: NO BAGS, ?, +, !
  ...(oH will not protect contents unless it's greased
when disabling a trap *don't* use /oDig (makes a hole; duh), use a pick-axe
DON'T expend much Pw on Plane of Water before portal location is known
  ...resting isn't guaranteed; you may stumble onto portal


